--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Attribution of derived works
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This dataset was collected on a deployment of the Train Ticket benchmark
(FudanSELab) and uses Chaos Mesh for fault injection. If you use this dataset,
please also cite:

- Train Ticket: X. Zhou et al., "Fault Analysis and Debugging of Microservice
  Systems: Industrial Survey, Benchmark System, and Empirical Study",
  IEEE TSE, 2018. https://github.com/FudanSELab/train-ticket (Apache-2.0)

- Chaos Mesh: https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh (Apache-2.0)

The Train Ticket source code and Chaos Mesh are distributed under the Apache
License 2.0; this dataset is a derived observational artifact and does not
redistribute their source.
